# <<< cc-suite <<<

*.tsbuildinfo

# Auto-advance local run-state
/dev-memo/run/last-batch-audit
# Batch-closeout transient sentinel (BATCH-CLOSEOUT-AUTO-00); written/removed only by
# scripts/workflow/batch-closeout.mjs, never committed.
/dev-memo/run/.closeout-pending

# A0.7 marker write — local-only run-state (WI-ENA11); markers/ledger are never committed.
/dev-memo/run/evidence/

# Local intake + run scratch (WI-13); never committed. `intake/` holds confidential
# client legal documents; `reports/` holds generated cc-suite audit artifacts;
# `override-reason.md` is consumed single-use override scratch (the reason is persisted
# in the committed run log).
/dev-memo/run/intake/
/dev-memo/run/reports/
/dev-memo/run/override-reason.md

# nlpm scoring history (local telemetry; see /nlpm:score)
.claude/nlpm-history.json

# ClauDepot writing workspace (2026-08-11). Active drafts and scratch may hold real client
# facts before anonymization, and posts/ + notes/ fall OUTSIDE the scan scope of
# apps/lawbar-desktop/scripts/check-no-real-data.mjs (SCOPE_HINTS covers case-box paths, the
# renderer, and test/contract fixtures — not new top-level dirs). This repo's history already
# carries one real-identifier leak that was never rewritten. Drafts stay out of git.
/posts/*
!/posts/.gitkeep
/notes/*
!/notes/.gitkeep
